00:13.280 --> 00:15.440
Or sometimes we call them packets.

00:15.560 --> 00:19.960
So now in order to understand this and how SQL works with this function, we're going to have a very

00:19.960 --> 00:20.840
simple example.

00:20.840 --> 00:21.400
So let's go.

00:21.440 --> 00:22.840
Okay we have the following setup.

