00:28.880 --> 00:31.760
So in order to do that we can use the entire function.

00:31.960 --> 00:35.040
It has different syntax than the other ranking functions.

00:35.040 --> 00:37.080
So it starts with in tile.

00:37.280 --> 00:39.280
Then we must define a number.

00:39.280 --> 00:41.720
So we cannot leave it empty like the other ranking.

00:41.880 --> 00:43.520
So here we have two buckets.

00:43.800 --> 00:46.680
Then over and here again we have to sort the data.

00:46.680 --> 00:51.200
